{"author":{"id":"b409816c5cd5ab140d1d52eb33aace35de44952bb794b19806fd57f6ecb1ace9"},"ops":[{"type":1,"timestamp":1792253641,"nonce":"nXzPOA5cRuEfmXrZ8jSpDlPfUhg=","title":"Python: a Num that also holds any boxed value (OTHER escape) is a net loss","message":"Tried and refuted. A `Ty::Num(mask)` gained an OTHER kind (tag 5, mask bit 16): any other value held as its box, the box's address in the int word. `join_num` of a number kind with `Object` gave `Num(kinds|other)` instead of `Object`, so a field or param written with numbers in one place and a dynamic value in another (chaos's GVector fields written from generic dunder bodies) kept its numbers unboxed.\n\nWhat it needed: `zb_num_word`/`zb_box_address`/`zb_box_at` to move a box through the int word, `kept` params on the conversion helpers so the release analysis does not free a box a Num holds, guarded arithmetic and comparison (numeric fast branch, boxed slow branch joined by `conditional_value`), and OTHER branches in `zb_num_eq`/`zb_num_lt`/truthiness.\n\nResult (retired instructions, one whole trial per kernel, Mac, Cranelift tiered, against 33587ac5): all 22 kernels check against CPython, but the total is 289.79G -\u003e 337.60G (1.165). raytrace 1.641, hexiom2 1.538, telco 1.458, chaos 1.332, richards 1.299, go 1.199, nbody 1.165. Only crypto_pyaes (0.894), spectral-norm (0.916) and deltablue (0.953) gain.\n\nWhy it loses: values that were plain `Object` become `Num(..|other)`, so every boundary with dynamic code converts (three calls in, one box out) and every operation carries a tag check and a slow branch; chaos's fields stay `Num(float|other)`, never `Float`, so its arithmetic stays guarded. `Num(None|other)` must not exist at all: it is `Object` with extra conversions.\n\nThe full state is kept at `refs/backup/python-num-other-escape` (f6b8f1cd). Bugs it exposed were fixed separately: instance-vs-value equality recursion, `__bool__`/`__len__` truthiness, and `num_of_box` moving earlier operands' hoisted statements after their readers.\n\nThe way to chaos and raytrace stays typing the dunder bodies and `__call__` (a42aae4, a22c5e1), not widening Num.","files":null}]}